      "title": {
        "en": "Attentive and caring veterinary staff"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Most pet owners praise the veterinarians, technicians, and front desk team for their warmth, empathy, and dedicated care. Clients frequently mention Dr. Maikel Gonzalez and assistant Roberto for their patience and willingness to answer questions. One reviewer noted frustration with an unhelpful assistant during a follow-up visit, but the vast majority of clients feel well supported."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 18,
      "title": {
        "en": "Gentle handling of furry patients"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients frequently highlight the loving and tender handling of their dogs and cats during wellness checkups and medical treatments. Reviewers appreciate that the team treats pets like family members, keeping nervous animals calm throughout physical exams and procedures. Pet parents describe their animals feeling comfortable and pampered in the clinic."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 11,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective diagnostics and surgical recovery"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners report dependable medical results across routine neutering, emergency treatments, severe infection management, and complex fracture surgeries. Multiple reviewers credit the clinic with saving their pets during critical illnesses. A dissatisfied client felt an underlying condition went undiagnosed, but most pet parents celebrate swift recoveries."
      }
    }
  ],
